# Bitter Chill {1}{U}: "When this Aura is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, you may pay {1}. If you do, scry 1, then draw a
# card." Bot1 enchants Bot2's Ornithopter on turn 3 (Mox Sapphire + Mox Ruby; the second Sapphire and Mox Jet stay untapped), and Bot2
# Disenchants the Aura on turn 4. Bot1 pays exactly {1} (Mox Jet) and the pool empties; the scry looks at Lightning Bolt (the card
# after the one drawn for turn 3), puts it on the bottom, and the draw takes Counterspell (the scry came first), and the
# second Sapphire stays untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Bitter Chill
Island
Island
Island
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mox Pearl
Disenchant
Island x4
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bitter Chill.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Disenchant.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Bitter Chill)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.PayCost
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Arrange( | Lightning Bolt)

